### Our changes

references/styles.md selects and re-describes the original styles rather than
copying the source text.

- Reduced 30 styles to three: 07 Swiss International, 13 Monochrome Minimal, and
  27 Architectural Blueprint. Density ledger L-17 records overlapping axes:
  07 and 13 share grammar and differ in palette. The other 27 introduce procurement
  evaluation deductions or disappear in monochrome print.
- Re-described three substantive axes: background brightness, title typeface,
  and decoration density.
- Added the Korean font contract, absent from all 30 upstream styles. This is
  original work and is not covered by that imported MIT license.

